cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MomentRT in research, please cite the software version used."
title: "MomentRT"
type: software
version: "0.2.1"
authors:
  - family-names: "Poinsinet de Sivry-Houle"
    given-names: "Martin"
abstract: >
  MomentRT is a Python package for deterministic light transport using
  angular-moment methods. It includes finite-element diffusion through
  structured media and tools for visualizing optical fields.
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - radiative transfer
  - light transport
  - diffusion
  - finite element method
  - tissue optics
